2118357110||mc_Responsiveness_help|How quickly the camera follows Geralt, on foot, indoors and swimming. Low values give a lazy camera that lets Geralt move away from the center of the screen; high values keep Geralt close to it.
2118357111||mc_DynamicZoom_help|In combat, the camera zooms out as more enemies are close and in view, up to 8. <font color="#9D75BF">Normal</font> and <font color="#9D75BF">High</font> set how far it zooms out for each one; <font color="#9D75BF">Off</font> keeps the zoom as it is.
2118357112||mc_DodgeFx_help|A short camera move when Geralt dodges or rolls.
2118357113||mc_SignFx_help|A short camera move when Geralt casts a sign, except Quen.
;
