2118357125||mc_CameraRange_help|How far from Geralt the camera stays, in exploration, in combat, during dodges and in Witcher Senses. Each preset (above) sets a range together with a <font color="#9D75BF">Camera Responsiveness</font> that suits it; choosing a range here keeps your own <font color="#9D75BF">Camera Responsiveness</font>.
