2118357128||option_mc_SoftLockCameraAssist|[Controller Only] Assisted Camera Rotation in Combat
2118357129||mc_AutoCameraCenter_help|The game's own setting, the same as under <font color="#9D75BF">Gameplay</font>, here for easy reach. Outside combat, on foot and while swimming, the camera turns behind Geralt while Geralt moves. Turning the camera yourself pauses it for a moment.
2118357130||mc_SoftLockCameraAssist_help|The game's own setting, the same as under <font color="#9D75BF">Gameplay</font>, here for easy reach. In combat, with a controller, the camera turns toward the enemies around Geralt. With keyboard and mouse it does nothing.
